index=botsv3 sourcetype=aws:cloudtrail earliest=0 eventName=ConsoleLogin
| fields user src_ip "additionalEventData.LoginTo"
| eventstats dc(user) as dc_user_usingloginurl by additionalEventData.LoginTo
| where dc_user_usingloginurl <= 3 ```AND NOT sr_ip IN ([list of acceptable ips])```
| stats values(src_ip) as src, values(additionalEventData.LoginTo) as dest by user